{title: Suhana Safar Aur Ye Mausam}
{artist: Mukesh Madhumati Salil Chowdhury}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] [D] [C] [Em],        Suhana safar aur yeh mausam haseen
[Em] [Am] [B],        Humein darr hai hum kho na jaaye kahin
[Em] [B],        Yeh kaun hansta hai phoolon mein chhupkar
[B] [Em],        Bahar bechain hai jiski dhun par
[Em] [Am],        Kahin gungun, kahin runjhun
[Em] [B],        Ki jaise nache zameen
[Em],        Suhana safar...
[Em] [B],        Yeh gori nadiyon ka chalna uchhalkar
[B] [Em],        Ki jaise allhad chale pi se milkar
[Em] [Am],        Pyare pyare yeh nazare
[Em] [B],        nisar hai har kahin
[Em],        Suhana safar...
[Em] [B],        Woh aasman jhuk raha hai zameen par
[B] [Em],        Yeh milan humne dekha yahin par
[Em] [Am],        Meri duniya, mere sapne
[Em] [B],        milenge shaayad yahin
[Em],        Suhana safar...
